[Options]

[A.]

<h2>Aries Point</h2>
<P>~y
News of the destroyed outpost has reached Martol, needless to say, he was not pleased.  He has
decided 
to take no chances. He has sent five priest to bring you in for public execution.
<$Config,Donebeenthere2=1>

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Fight,DoNothing,0




