[ai3TemplehalfDead]
~yMy Lord, A messenger has just arrived with grave news.~.
<P>
<I>Messenger: </I>Tilgon's Temple has taken substantial damage, Reenforcements are requested.
<P>

~[IwindWalker,9]

[ai3PriestDead]
~yAs Tilgon's body is consumed upon the alter, a voice rings out.
<p>
<I>TILGON: </I>Lord, Avenge my death.
<$Config,DoneAllyDead1=1>
$Button=Test,Tell,surrender


[ai1PriestCaptured][SURRENDER]
<h2>~yCAPTURED~.</h2><br>
<I>Lord Byron: </I>Throw him into shackles!
<?!{DoneAllyDead1}>And, sacrifice this spineless Bounty Hunter!  </?>
<P>
<I>Lord Byron: </I>Enjoy your last day, for tomorrow you will be sacrificed before the masses
on Terra.
<p>
$Button=OK ,missionbegin,execute

[ai1TemplehalfDead]
~yMy Lord, A messenger has just arrived with grave news.~.
<P>
<I>Messenger: </I>Our Temple has taken substantial damage. What are your orders?
<P>

~[IwindWalker,9]

$Button=Hold at all Cost,Tell,Stay
$Button=Surrender,Tell,SURRENDER

[Stay]
<I>Messenger: </I>It shall be done, my Lord.
<P>
~[IwindWalker,9]
$Button=Send the Messenger Back,DoNothing,0


[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<?{DoneAllyDead1}>   $Timeout=0,TELL,NOALLY </?>
<?!{DoneAllyDead1}>  $Timeout=0,TELL,ALLYLIVED </?>

[NOALLY]
<h2>~yVictory is Yours</h2><br>
<I>YOU: </I>Tilgon, your death has been avenged!<br>
$Menu=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1
$Menu=Lay seige to Terra,MissionBegin,last

[ALLYLIVED]
<h2>~yVictory is Yours</h2><br>
<I>TILGON: </I>The Collector was no match for our combined force.<br>
$Menu=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1
$Menu=Lay seige to Terra with Tilgon,MissionBegin,last1 
$Menu=Lay seige to Terra Alone,Tell,PARTING

[PARTING]
<I>YOU: </I>Tilgon, I feel that I must continue alone. <br>
<P>
<I>TILGON: </I>As you wish my Lord. May the Furies watch over you. <br>
<BR>
$Button=Continue,MissionBegin,last


[END]



